                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Why are there so many people in the meeting area?\\nB: There’s a demonstration of the new medical equipment that our hospital might purchase.\\nA: What’s wrong with the equipment we have now? I thought we just upgraded a lot of it recently.\\nB: A lot of the new equipment that is being introduced there is digital. It would replace all our films and older imaging equipment. It would also save the hospital money in the long run and is much easier to use.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
